** All YoY measures compare the latest available quarter in the current filter context against the same quarter in the prior year (CurrentYear - 1). 
Percentage-growth metrics use DIVIDE, while rate-based metrics return percentage-point differences (CurrentValue - PreviousValue).

##1  _YOY num GOSI (% Growth)

_YOY num GOSI = 
VAR LatestDate     = CALCULATE(MAX('أرقام GOSI'[الربع]))
VAR CurrentYear    = YEAR(LatestDate)
VAR CurrentQuarter = QUARTER(LatestDate)
VAR CurrentValue = 
    CALCULATE(
        [_GOSI Value],
        REMOVEFILTERS(Calender),
        Calender[Year] = CurrentYear,
        Calender[Quarter Number] = CurrentQuarter
    )
VAR PreviousValue = 
    CALCULATE(
        [_GOSI Value],
        REMOVEFILTERS(Calender),
        Calender[Year] = CurrentYear - 1,
        Calender[Quarter Number] = CurrentQuarter
    )
RETURN
DIVIDE(CurrentValue - PreviousValue, PreviousValue)

